# Assimilate the Wounded ({2}{B}) in a three-player game: Innocent Blood makes each opponent sacrifice their only creature
# on turn 4, so each graveyard holds a creature card put there from the battlefield this turn. "For each opponent, assimilate
# up to one target creature card from that player's graveyard" (CR 608.2f) takes both as one event: Grizzly Bears (2/2) and
# Runeclaw Bear (2/2) enter under Bot1's control as 3/3 Borg artifact creatures (CR 122.6, 205.1b, 614.12). The Runeclaw Bear
# Bot2 discarded to Faithless Looting was never on the battlefield, and Bot3's Runeclaw Bear is not in Bot2's graveyard: both
# are refused for Bot2's slot.

